Package: SynPAL
Title: Synthetic Phenotype-Assisted Likelihood for Genome-Wide Association Studies of Partially Observed Phenotypes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shuang", "Song", email = "shuangsong@hsph.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Genome-wide association analysis of phenotypes measured in a subset of the samples.
    The observed phenotype is combined with a synthetic phenotype, generated by machine learning or
    generative AI for all samples, in a likelihood-based test for continuous, binary and count phenotypes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6)
Imports: BEDMatrix, data.table, fastglm, MASS, parallel, splines2, stats
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
